# [UCP] U3 -- THE ISLAND over ILL-FORMED UTF-8 (ucp_design.md §3.5): a
# byte that does not decode is ⊥, one byte in no set and not a word
# character, forward, in the reverse walk's step back, and in the seeds.
# Same patterns as tests/ucp/island.rxt, subjects mixing well-formed
# characters with stray continuations, truncated leads, 0xFF, overlongs,
# surrogates and > U+10FFFF.
#
# ORACLE: libpcre2 10.46 2025-08-27 under PCRE2_UTF|PCRE2_UCP|PCRE2_MATCH_INVALID_UTF
