# ucpu3b_evidence/gen_island_rxt.py. 13 cells whose answer is an EMPTY
# match beside an ill-formed byte are left out: match_api.md §9.5's
# documented divergence of pcrec's byte machines, which the island
# inherits. verify_ucp.py cannot check this file (it spells the options
# as in-pattern verbs, and plain PCRE2_UTF refuses these subjects), which
# is why it lives here, beside axis13_ctx_illformed.rxt.

